# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output — colcon writes one tree per ROS distro (build_humble /
# install_humble everywhere now). The globs cover every distro variant at any
# depth, so a stray build_jazzy/ from the old setup is caught too.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build*/
install*/
log*/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Per-device files. Anything whose correct contents differ between the desktop,
# the laptop and the Jetson must not be tracked — that is the single rule that
# keeps three machines on one branch without conflicts.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/settings.json
.arc-local.env

# Dormant research kept locally only: safe_control, online_adaptive_cbf,
# drone_cbf_penn, fsc_autopilot_ros2. Not in this repo, not on the Jetson.
/reference/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party trees installed separately, never vendored here
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PX4-Autopilot/
Micro-XRCE-DDS-Agent/
micro-ROS-Agent/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Datasets and bulk training output. Deployed model weights are NOT covered
# here — they are flight assets loaded at runtime by penn_gamma_selector and
# are tracked directly.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pkl
*.csv
*.save

# Bulk experiment output stays local; only the frozen hardware scene sets are
# tracked as deliverables.
research/penn_gat/results/
!research/penn_gat/results/hardware_scenes_final_*/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
.vscode/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime scratch. *.log is ignored, but the hardware scene set tracks its
# SITL run logs under research/**/results/ as deliverables — negated back in.
# Colcon's log dirs are already covered by the log*/ glob above.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pid
*.log
!research/**/results/**/*.log
